author":{"name":"Edy Cu","email":"edy.cu@live.com","date":"2026-09-20T10:13:07Z"},"committer":{"name":"Edy Cu","email":"edy.cu@live.com","date":"2026-09-20T10:13:54Z"},"message":"test(core): 100% statement/branch/function/line coverage + thresholds\n\nAdds targeted tests for every previously-uncovered line/branch in\npackages/core/src, all deterministic and network-free (existing fixture/\nreplay/fake-client helpers only):\n\n- cache.ts: DiskCache surviving a corrupt on-disk entry, cachedClientFromEnv\n  (present and missing NANSEN_API_KEY), an unknown endpoint falling back to\n  1 credit.\n- client.ts: clientFromEnv (present and missing NANSEN_API_KEY), an unknown\n  endpoint falling back to 1 credit, a timeout exhausted on every attempt\n  recorded with error \"timeout\", nansen.transactions/txLookup (used by\n  scripts/seed.ts and scripts/spike.ts, previously untested).\n- clues.ts: a top5/trade row missing symbol/roi/pnl falling back to \"?\"/\n  null, a non-Error rejection reason being stringified instead of read as\n  .message.\n- round.ts: score() skipping a round cardId missing from the cards map.\n- sources.ts / draw.ts: null labels and missing addresses tolerated on\n  every sourcing list, a regular candidate seen on two token pages not\n  double-counted, a \"regular\" draw, a random class draw (no opts.class),\n  the fixed \"the live Smart Money feed\" progress label, a null label on a\n  smart-money trade row and on an exchange holder row.\n\nvitest.config.ts now sets coverage.thresholds to 100 on all four metrics so\na future regression fails CI instead of silently eroding coverage.","tree":{"sha":"75048ec25f970d11d7ba66b8b4792cfd479e7c2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edycutjong/labelme/git/trees/75048ec25f970d11d7ba66b8b4792cfd479e7c2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edycutjong/labelme/git/commits/05e5ffc36763c1babb6270343dee496707aac0dc","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null